Tripwire, by Dhairya Pandya
  https://github.com/dhairya-pandya/beam-tripwire
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/dhairyapandya/beam-tripwire-episodes
  - ouroboros/render/tamper.py reimplements Tripwire's test-tampering
    detector (src/tripwire/grading.py tamper_calls and
    src/tripwire/conditions.py touches_tests) and the protected-path rule
    of its base harness, beam-apprentice (src/apprentice/patches.py
    is_protected).
  - ouroboros/analysis/monitors.py ports Tripwire's intent keyword monitor.
    tests/test_analysis_monitors.py carries Tripwire's own intent test cases
    from tests/test_grading.py.
  - ouroboros/render/schemas.py transcribes the tool schemas of
    beam-apprentice (src/apprentice/tools.py), and ouroboros/render/tripwire.py
    rebuilds Tripwire's requests from its stored episodes.

Claimed vs Done, by Brasa Studios
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/BrasaStudios/claimed-vs-done
  - ouroboros/render/schemas.py transcribes its tool schemas (cvd/tools.py).
  - ouroboros/render/cvd.py rebuilds its requests from its harness
    (cvd/loop.py and cvd/client.py) and its stored transcripts.

Beam-1.0-501B-A23B, by Reflection AI
  https://huggingface.co/reflection/Beam-1.0-501B-A23B-FP8
  revision 7449ff0f358983375e15ec9624b315de58ce8489
  - vendor/beam/ holds config.json, generation_config.json,
    tokenizer.json, tokenizer_config.json, chat_template.jinja and
    model.safetensors.index.json from that repository.
